，启动与状态读取都成功，但旧分类器返回失败并在约 7 秒后停止了服务。现在将明确出现的空 Job 解释为没有排队任务；缺失、重复或畸形字段仍拒绝，Bash 3/5 使用一致的显式退出行为。\n\n同时保留诊断中原始字段的摘要，并覆盖 uint32 十进制边界与无结尾换行的输入。状态策略、工作流、预算、清理和一次性续跑资格保持不变。关联 #1018；该请求已按授权停止并清零，本 PR 不再次采购资源。\n\n## Release notes / 发布说明\n\n- [x] I added every user-visible change to `CHANGELOG.md` under `[Unreleased]`.\n- [ ] This pull request has no user-visible change. I explained why below and a maintainer added the `skip-changelog` label.\n\n## Verification / 验证\n\n全部新回归在实现前冻结并保留原失败。Bash 3/5 各 26 个 parser 场景与 11 个实际 readiness-loop 分支通过；真实故障前的 104 字节输入及 SHA 均保留。相关回归每个 shell 各 9 根用例、74 个 pass 事件，4 个 Darwin journal summary 子检查因既有 awk 限制跳过，不能计作 Linux 覆盖。语法、格式、diff 检查及原 policy 的 `flow-doc-contracts` 通过。\n\n规范与行为两轴独立复核均无发现，独立的 56 个输入探针通过。精确提交的完整 Linux CI 将在提交后补充。本地回归不代表 2 小时预演或 72 小时长稳通过。\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-21T14:09:22Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T14:34:23Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"8cdee508fd2b5b5383e64a201e033d3ffef37ba0","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"WuKongIM:codex/v3-rc-systemd-job","ref":"codex/v3-rc-systemd-job","repo":{"id":638054601,"node_id":"R_kgDOJgfwyQ","name":"WuKongIM","full_name":"WuKongIM/WuKongIM","owner":{"login":"WuKongIM","id":132860831,"node_id":"O_kgDOB-tLnw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132860831?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM","html_url":"https://github.com/WuKongIM","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/repos"